Tutorial_ModManager:
This is the Mod Management interface. Here you can:

• Import or drag in your own Mods;
• Disable or enable Mods;
• Check for Mod updates (and choose 'Don't remind again' if preferred);
• Click the gear icon on a Mod (if available) to quickly jump to its configuration;
• Access a rich Mod market to download any Mods you want to play!

Tips: All Mod operations can be performed while the game is running. Click 'Restart Game' after to apply changes.

Tutorial_ChartManager:
This is the Chart Management interface. Here you can:

• Import or drag in charts;
• Preview or group/categorize charts. Click the multi-select button in the top-right (grouping is reflected in-game, but cannot be done while the game is running);
• Click the toolbox button next to sorting options to check for duplicates or clean up damaged charts;

Tips: Press and hold Ctrl + A/D under custom categories in-game to quickly switch categories.

Tutorial_AlbumCollection:
This is the QQ Group Charts interface. Here you can:

• Download any charts you want to play. 95% of charts from various QQ groups are collected here;
• When downloading, click the top-right button to download all charts in the folder with one click!

Tutorial_ConfigManager:
This is the Configuration interface, responsible for adjustable settings of some Mods. Here you can:

• View all existing, freely adjustable configuration files;
• Press shift + mouse wheel in input boxes to scroll their content;
• Right double-click a file to quickly delete it.
